# Modules files stay long

_Last mapped: 2026-10-27._

Files under `components/Modules` are allowed to be long: they are ported workspace apps (Tidy, itinerary, grad search, and the other module bodies), length there is expected, and they should not be split for line count alone. Why: `components/Modules/README.md`.
